  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Trying to create a specific version of a binary's metadata",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "attrs": {
      "language": "java"
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "> curl -i -ufedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin -H\"Content-type: text/turtle\" -H\"Memento-Datetime: Tue, 21 May 2019 18:30:00 GMT\" -d \" @prefix dc: <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/> . <> dc:title \\\"Old stuff\\\" .\" -XPOST http://localhost:8080/rest/test_version/5a9233ac-25ca-478a-b946-c9867a2495f8/fcr:metadata/fcr:versions -H\"Prefer: handling=lenient; received=\\\"minimal\\\"\"\r\n\r\nHTTP/1.1 400 Bad Request\r\nDate: Thu, 06 Jun 2019 19:57:41 GMT\r\nSet-Cookie: JSESSIONID=5flksu9few3r1w9mlpfp4430x;Path=/\r\nExpires: Thu, 01 Jan 1970 00:00:00 GMT\r\nSet-Cookie: rememberMe=deleteMe; Path=/; Max-Age=0; Expires=Wed, 05-Jun-2019 19:57:41 GMT\r\nLink: <http://localhost:8080/static/constraints/ConstraintViolationException.rdf>; rel=\"http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#constrainedBy\"\r\nContent-Type: text/plain;charset=utf-8\r\nContent-Length: 80\r\nServer: Jetty(9.3.25.v20180904)\r\nMissing required property http://fedora.info/definitions/v4/repository#createdBy",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "codeBlock"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": " ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "According to the documentation I shouldn't need the ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "code"
        }
       ],
       "text": "Prefer: handling=lenient; received=\"minimal\"",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": " but I tried it anyways. Am I doing something wrong here?",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
